        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第1問・解答解説</div><h2>第1問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"オ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">オ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"コ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">コ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"サ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">サ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ス: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ス</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"セ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">セ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ソ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ソ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"タ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">タ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"チ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">チ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ツ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ツ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"テ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">テ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ト: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ト</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ナ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ナ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ニ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ニ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ヌ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ヌ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ネ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ネ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-01\">問1　極大値・極小値</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初に確認</strong><p>分母が0になる <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}</span> では関数が定義されません。増減を考えるときは、この2点で区間を分けます。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">商の微分公式で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}</span> を微分します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)=\\frac{3x^2(2x^2-1)-4x^4}{(2x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{x^2(2x^2-3)}{(2x^2-1)^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f&#39;(x)=\\frac{3x^2(2x^2-1)-4x^4}{(2x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{x^2(2x^2-3)}{(2x^2-1)^2}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2},\\ 0,\\ \\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f&#39;(x)=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2},\\ 0,\\ \\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</div><p class=\"prose\">極値と変曲点を一つの表で確認するため、2階微分も求めます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;(x)=\\frac{2x(2x^2+3)}{(2x^2-1)^3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f&#39;&#39;(x)=\\frac{2x(2x^2+3)}{(2x^2-1)^3}</div><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll answer-table-scroll--variation\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table answer-table--variation\"><caption>f(x) の増減・凹凸表</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\infty</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">0</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span></th><th scope=\"col\"></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"+\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\">+\\infty</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f&#39;(x)</span></th><td></td><td>+</td><td>0</td><td>−</td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td>−</td><td>0</td><td>−</td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td>−</td><td>0</td><td>+</td><td></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f&#39;&#39;(x)</span></th><td></td><td>−</td><td>−</td><td>−</td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td>+</td><td>0</td><td>−</td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td>+</td><td>+</td><td>+</td><td></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)</span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\infty</span></td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"増加・上に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 30 C18 15 37 7 58 6\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M50 3 L59 6 L53 13\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> 極大</td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"減少・上に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 6 C29 7 48 17 58 30\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M50 27 L59 31 L56 22\"/></svg></span></td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"減少・下に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 6 C16 20 35 29 58 30\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M51 25 L59 30 L52 34\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">0</span> 変曲点</td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"減少・上に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 6 C29 7 48 17 58 30\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M50 27 L59 31 L56 22\"/></svg></span></td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"減少・下に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 6 C16 20 35 29 58 30\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M51 25 L59 30 L52 34\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> 極小</td><td><span class=\"answer-trend\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"増加・下に凸\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"answer-trend__curve\" d=\"M6 30 C29 29 48 19 58 6\"/><path class=\"answer-trend__head\" d=\"M50 9 L59 5 L57 14\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"+\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\">+\\infty</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"prose\">増減表より、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span> では <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f&#39;(x)</span> が正から負へ、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span> では負から正へ変わります。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=0</span> では符号が変わらないため極値ではありません。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8},\\qquad f\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8},\\qquad f\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>極大値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span>、極小値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-02\">問2　変曲点</h3><p class=\"prose\">増減・凹凸表を見ると、定義域内で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;(x)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f&#39;&#39;(x)=0</span> となる <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=0</span> の前後で符号が正から負へ変わっています。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f(0)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(0)=0</div><p class=\"prose\">したがって、グラフの凹凸が切り替わる点の座標は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(0,0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(0,0)</span> です。</p><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>変曲点は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(0,0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(0,0)</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-03\">問3　斜めの漸近線</h3><p class=\"prose\">分子を分母で割ると、直線部分と0へ近づく部分に分けられます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(x)=\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(f(x)-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(f(x)-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}=0</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\frac12,\\ b=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\frac12,\\ b=0</span> で、漸近線は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=\\frac12x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=\\frac12x</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-04\">問4　異なる実数解の個数</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}</span> は元の方程式を満たさないので、方程式を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)=k\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)=k</span> の形へ変形できます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"x^3-2kx^2+k=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}=k\" data-display-mode=\"true\">x^3-2kx^2+k=0\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}=k</div><p class=\"prose\">問1の増減・凹凸表と問3の漸近線から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=f(x)</span> の概形を描き、水平線 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=k\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=k</span> との共有点を数えます。</p><figure class=\"answer-figure-placeholder is-landscape\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"iwate-2025-math-q1-function-graph\"><div class=\"answer-figure-placeholder__frame\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"有理関数と水平線のグラフ（図版準備中）\"><span>図版準備中</span><strong>ここに「有理関数と水平線のグラフ」が入ります</strong><p>y=f(x)、水平線 y=k、縦の漸近線 x=±√2/2、斜めの漸近線 y=x/2、極大点・極小点を示す予定です。</p></div><figcaption>図：y=f(x) と y=k の共有点（独自作図へ差し替え予定）</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\">水平線が極大点または極小点に接するときが境界です。極大値・極小値 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> を基準に共有点の個数を整理します。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table\"><caption>kの範囲と異なる実数解の個数</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">kの条件</th><th scope=\"col\">個数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>1個</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>2個</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k&lt;-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k&lt;-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> または <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k&gt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k&gt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>3個</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>中央の範囲で1個、境界で2個、外側で3個です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第2問・解答解説</div><h2>第2問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"オ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">オ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"コサ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">コサ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ス: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ス</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"セ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">セ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-01\">問1　角Aと辺CA</h3><figure class=\"answer-figure-placeholder is-landscape\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"iwate-2025-math-q2-geometry\"><div class=\"answer-figure-placeholder__frame\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形と外接円の位置関係図（図版準備中）\"><span>図版準備中</span><strong>ここに「三角形と外接円の位置関係図」が入ります</strong><p>三角形ABC、外接円、点D・E、内心I、外心O、線分AE・BCの位置関係を示す予定です。</p></div><figcaption>図：A・B・C・D・E・I・Oの位置関係（独自作図へ差し替え予定）</figcaption></figure><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"CA=x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">CA=x</span> とおきます。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BC=\\sqrt7&gt;AB=2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BC=\\sqrt7&gt;AB=2</span> なので <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"A&gt;C\" data-display-mode=\"false\">A&gt;C</span> です。もし角Cが鈍角なら角Aも鈍角となって三角形に矛盾するため、角Cは鋭角です。したがって、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin C=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sin C=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}7</span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\cos C=\\frac2{\\sqrt7}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\cos C=\\frac2{\\sqrt7}</span> です。角Cに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"2^2=x^2+(\\sqrt7)^2-2x\\sqrt7\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt7}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">2^2=x^2+(\\sqrt7)^2-2x\\sqrt7\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt7}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"x^2-4x+3=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=1,3\" data-display-mode=\"true\">x^2-4x+3=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=1,3</div><p class=\"prose\">条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt7&gt;x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sqrt7&gt;x</span> を満たすのは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=1</span> です。3辺が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB=2, AC=1, BC=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AB=2, AC=1, BC=\\sqrt7</span> と分かったので、今度は角Aに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\cos A=\\frac{2^2+1^2-(\\sqrt7)^2}{2\\cdot2\\cdot1}=-\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\cos A=\\frac{2^2+1^2-(\\sqrt7)^2}{2\\cdot2\\cdot1}=-\\frac12</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle BAC=120^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle BAC=120^\\circ</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"CA=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">CA=1</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-02\">問2　BEとCE</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BD:DC=2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BD:DC=2:1</span> であり、問1から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB:AC=2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AB:AC=2:1</span> です。角の二等分線定理の逆より、直線AEは角Aを二等分します。円周角が等しいため、対応する弦も等しく <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE</span> です。</p><p class=\"prose\">円に内接する四角形ABECでは、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle BEC=180^\\circ-\\angle BAC=60^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle BEC=180^\\circ-\\angle BAC=60^\\circ</span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE=y\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE=y</span> として三角形BECに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"7=y^2+y^2-2y^2\\cos60^\\circ=y^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\">7=y^2+y^2-2y^2\\cos60^\\circ=y^2</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE=\\sqrt7</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-03\">問3　ADとAE</h3><p class=\"prose\">DはBCを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2:1</span> に内分するので、Aを始点とする位置ベクトルで表します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\frac13\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\frac23\\overrightarrow{AC}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\frac13\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\frac23\\overrightarrow{AC}</div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\overrightarrow{AB}|^2=4\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\overrightarrow{AB}|^2=4</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\overrightarrow{AC}|^2=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\overrightarrow{AC}|^2=1</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=2\\cos120^\\circ=-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=2\\cos120^\\circ=-1</span> を代入します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"AD^2=\\frac19\\cdot4+\\frac49\\cdot1+2\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot(-1)=\\frac49\" data-display-mode=\"true\">AD^2=\\frac19\\cdot4+\\frac49\\cdot1+2\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot(-1)=\\frac49</div><p class=\"prose\">よって <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AD=\\frac23\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AD=\\frac23</span> です。点Dで2本の弦AEとBCが交わるので、方べきの定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac23\\left(AE-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{2\\sqrt7}{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt7}{3}=\\frac{14}{9}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac23\\left(AE-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{2\\sqrt7}{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt7}{3}=\\frac{14}{9}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AD=\\frac23\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AD=\\frac23</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AE=3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AE=3</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-04\">問4　内心と外心の距離</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>ベクトルで位置を表す</strong><p>Aを基準に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\boldsymbol b=\\overrightarrow{AB}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\boldsymbol b=\\overrightarrow{AB}</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\boldsymbol c=\\overrightarrow{AC}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\boldsymbol c=\\overrightarrow{AC}</span> とおきます。問1より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\boldsymbol b|^2=4\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\boldsymbol b|^2=4</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\boldsymbol c|^2=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\boldsymbol c|^2=1</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\boldsymbol b\\cdot\\boldsymbol c=-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\boldsymbol b\\cdot\\boldsymbol c=-1</span> です。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">内心Iは辺の長さを重みとする内分点です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BC=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BC=\\sqrt7</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"CA=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">CA=1</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB=2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AB=2</span> なので、AからIへのベクトルは次のようになります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AI}=\\frac{\\boldsymbol b+2\\boldsymbol c}{3+\\sqrt7}=\\frac{3-\\sqrt7}{2}(\\boldsymbol b+2\\boldsymbol c)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\overrightarrow{AI}=\\frac{\\boldsymbol b+2\\boldsymbol c}{3+\\sqrt7}=\\frac{3-\\sqrt7}{2}(\\boldsymbol b+2\\boldsymbol c)</div><p class=\"prose\">外心Oを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AO}=s\\boldsymbol b+t\\boldsymbol c\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\overrightarrow{AO}=s\\boldsymbol b+t\\boldsymbol c</span> とおきます。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OA=OB=OC\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OA=OB=OC</span> を展開して得られる2本の一次方程式を解きます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"4s-2-t=0,\\qquad -s+t-\\frac12=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\overrightarrow{AO}=\\frac56\\boldsymbol b+\\frac43\\boldsymbol c\" data-display-mode=\"true\">4s-2-t=0,\\qquad -s+t-\\frac12=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\overrightarrow{AO}=\\frac56\\boldsymbol b+\\frac43\\boldsymbol c</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{OI}=\\overrightarrow{AI}-\\overrightarrow{AO}=\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\boldsymbol b+\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\boldsymbol c\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\overrightarrow{OI}=\\overrightarrow{AI}-\\overrightarrow{AO}=\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\boldsymbol b+\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\boldsymbol c</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"OI^2=4\\left(\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)^2-2\\left(\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"true\">OI^2=4\\left(\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)^2-2\\left(\\frac{4-3\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)\\left(\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{10-6\\sqrt7}{6}\\right)^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OI^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OI^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7</span> です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第3問",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第3問・解答解説</div><h2>第3問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エオ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エオ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケコ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケコ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"サ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">サ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-01\">準備　全事象</h3><p class=\"prose\">8枚はすべて異なり、4枚を選んで順番に並べます。したがって全事象は次の1680通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"{}_8P_4=8\\cdot7\\cdot6\\cdot5=1680\" data-display-mode=\"true\">{}_8P_4=8\\cdot7\\cdot6\\cdot5=1680</div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-02\">問1　位置を固定して数える</h3><p class=\"prose\">1を左から2番目に固定すると、残り3か所は残る7枚から選んで並べるため <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_7P_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_7P_3</span> 通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{{}_7P_3}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac18\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{{}_7P_3}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac18</div><p class=\"prose\">1と8を両端に置く順序は2通り、中央2か所には残る6枚から2枚を並べます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac1{28}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac1{28}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>確率は順に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac18\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac18</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{28}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac1{28}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-03\">問2　両端の偶奇が同じ</h3><p class=\"prose\">偶数は4枚、奇数も4枚です。両端を偶数にする並べ方は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_2</span> 通りで、中央は残る6枚から2枚を並べるので <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_6P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_6P_2</span> 通りです。両端が奇数の場合も同数です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2\\cdot{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac37\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{2\\cdot{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac37</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac37\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac37</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-04\">問3　1と8を一つのブロックにする</h3><p class=\"prose\">1と8のブロックを置ける位置は3か所、ブロック内の順序は2通りです。残り2か所へは残る6枚から2枚を並べます。</p><figure class=\"answer-figure-placeholder is-wide\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"iwate-2025-math-q3-adjacency-layout\"><div class=\"answer-figure-placeholder__frame\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1と8を一つのブロックにした配置図（図版準備中）\"><span>図版準備中</span><strong>ここに「1と8を一つのブロックにした配置図」が入ります</strong><p>4つの枠のうち、2枚ブロックを左端・中央・右端に置く3通りを横並びで示す予定です。</p></div><figcaption>図：1と8が隣り合う3つの配置（独自作図へ差し替え予定）</figcaption></figure><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3\\cdot2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac3{28}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{3\\cdot2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac3{28}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac3{28}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac3{28}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-05\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-05\">問4　偶数が連続しない並べ方</h3><p class=\"prose\">偶数の使用枚数で分けます。偶数2枚なら、4か所から隣り合わない2か所を選ぶ方法が3通りあります。偶数1枚なら位置は4通り、偶数0枚なら奇数4枚を並べるだけです。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table\"><caption>条件を満たす並べ方</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">偶数の枚数</th><th scope=\"col\">位置の選び方</th><th scope=\"col\">カードの並べ方</th><th scope=\"col\">小計</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2枚</td><td>3通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_4P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_4P_2</span></td><td>432通り</td></tr><tr><td>1枚</td><td>4通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_1\\cdot{}_4P_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_1\\cdot{}_4P_3</span></td><td>384通り</td></tr><tr><td>0枚</td><td>1通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_4\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_4</span></td><td>24通り</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{432+384+24}{1680}=\\frac{840}{1680}=\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{432+384+24}{1680}=\\frac{840}{1680}=\\frac12</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac12</span> です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
